    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "What in particular does a person gain when he or she becomes a serious collector?",
      "translation": "作者最喜欢哪一种收藏？",
      "startTime": 8.71,
      "endTime": 17.11,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "What",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "什么"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "People tend to amass possessions, sometimes without being aware of doing so.",
      "translation": "人们为了不同的原因收藏东西。",
      "startTime": 17.12,
      "endTime": 22.95,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "collect",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "收藏"
          },
          {
            "word": "reasons",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "原因"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Indeed they can have a delightful surprise when they find something useful which they did not know they owned.",
      "translation": "有些人收藏是为了投资，希望增值。",
      "startTime": 22.96,
      "endTime": 30.67,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Those who never have to move house become indiscriminate collectors of what can only be described as clutter.",
      "translation": "另一些人收藏则是为了乐趣。",
      "startTime": 30.68,
      "endTime": 38.26,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "House",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "房子"
          },
          {
            "word": "What",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "什么"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "They leave unwanted objects in drawers, cupboards and attics for years, in the belief that they may one day need just those very things.",
      "translation": "虽然有些人可能会说这只是为了消磨时间。",
      "startTime": 38.27,
      "endTime": 48.39,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          },
          {
            "word": "Very",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "很，非常"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "As they grow old, people also accumulate belongings for two other reasons,",
      "translation": "在我看来，没有任何一种爱好比收藏更迷人。",
      "startTime": 48.4,
      "endTime": 54.84,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Old",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "老的，旧的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "lack of physical and mental energy, both of which are essential in turning out and throwing away, and sentiment.",
      "translation": "你可以收藏任何东西：邮票、贝壳、蝴蝶、帽子等等。",
      "startTime": 54.85,
      "endTime": 63.54,
      "analysis": {
