            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "知识"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "perhaps with relatives who are dead, and so they gradually acquire a value beyond their true worth.",
      "translation": "如果你收藏邮票，你会了解各个国家的地理和历史。",
      "startTime": 68.41,
